| Severity | Vulnerability Name                | CVE ID(s)     | Description                                                         | Recommended Fix                        |
| -------- | --------------------------------- | ------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------- | -------------------------------------- |
| Critical | OpenSSL Multiple Vulnerabilities  | CVE-XXXX-XXXX | Multiple flaws in OpenSSL could allow remote code execution or DoS. | Update OpenSSL to the latest version.  |
| High     | Apache HTTP Server Path Traversal | CVE-XXXX-XXXX | Could allow attackers to read sensitive files.                      | Upgrade to Apache 2.4.57+.             |
| High     | Samba Remote Code Execution       | CVE-XXXX-XXXX | Could allow unauthenticated RCE.                                    | Update Samba and disable guest access. |

